BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260503
DTSTAMP:20260501T000232
CREATED:20260305T200924Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260430T091541Z
UID:10048553-1777604400-1777690799@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:TONIGHT | Electro Lust w/ Magenta Sunshine
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, May 1 | 7:00PM Doors | 8:00PM Show | 20+ advance Event Details and Tickets \nOpener Magenta Sunshine encompasses a wide stratum of Asheville\, NC-based musicians and artists.  The group has gained popularity for high-energy live performances and is known for incorporating elements of rock\, jazz\, and world music into through-composed compositions.  Described as\, “electrifying and elegant”. magentasunshine.com \nLater\, Step into the soundwaves of Electro Lust\, and suddenly you’re whisked away\, careening from the neon-lit confines of a Miami nightclub\, drifting to the sun-soaked sands of a Brazilian beach\, and finally landing amidst the vibrant chaos of Cuban streets. All the while\, the soundtrack to this journey is an eclectic hip-hop mix tape\, a melodic manifesto that defies convention and invites you to lose yourself in the raw energy of the Electro Lust experience. Strap in and let the music guide you through this electrifying tapestry of sound and sensation. \nAt the core of Electro Lust beats the hearts of Grammy Award-winning artists from Asheville\, NC’s musical scene – Members of Yo Mama’s Big Fat Booty Band\, The Fritz\, Empire Strikes Brass\, & Marcus King Band. Their odyssey into the realms of Funk\, Latin\, Cuban\, and Afrobeat reads like a musical adventure\, spawned from encounters with diverse cultures while on the road and under the influence of vinyl treasures unearthed in record shops scattered across the nation. electrolustmusic.com \nRevival is located right in the heart of downtown Asheville’s vibrant South Slope Brewery District. You’ll find us just around the corner from local favorites like Hi-Wire Brewing and Ben’s Tune-Up.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/electro-lust-w-magenta-sunshine/
LOCATION:Revival\, 66 Asheland Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/646789692_122155756064956711_7659081748932341628_n-e1772741315822.jpg
GEO:35.5917821;-82.555861
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Revival 66 Asheland Avenue Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=66 Asheland Avenue:geo:-82.555861,35.5917821
END:VEVENT
