UID:10059313-1777658400-1777665600@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Los Gun Show | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss LOS Gun Show\, the ultimate blues and garage rock super band featuring members from Drunken Prayer\, Pleasure Chest\, The Reigning Sound\, and more. Join us for an evening of rockin’ psych blues this Friday starting at 6pm. Have a cold one\, try our new taco truck and enjoy the sounds.\nFree for everyone and everyone welcome!\n\n\n\n\nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com \n  \nScreenshot\n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/los-gun-show-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-25-100242-e1777125804963.png
END:VEVENT
